      "content": "i don't want a professional. i don't want to talk about 'coping' or 'healing.' i just want to be with him. it feels like i'm being punished by staying here while he's gone. does it even make sense to keep going when the person you were meant to live with is just... gone? it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to not be here anymore.",
